cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "InvariantSet"
abstract: "Robust invariant and reachable sets for discrete-time linear systems with bounded disturbances — polytope support functions, Minkowski sum, Pontryagin difference and intersection, the recursive maximal robust invariant set with a declared convergence criterion, iteration cap and an explicit non-convergence report, hand-computed known-answer tests for 1-D and 2-D systems, and measured numerical behaviour including redundant-constraint tolerance, vertex-count growth and a documented case where a tolerance change alters the answer."
type: software
